      <h3 class="mt-3">Saudi destination ports and CFS roles</h3>
      <p>
        Mawani-operated Saudi ports handled <strong>8.3 million TEU in 2025</strong> (+10.6% year on
        year), a MEDIUM-confidence figure from trade press because mawani.gov.sa was unavailable
        during research. For LCL, the destination CFS role matters as much as the port name because
        deconsolidation, storage and delivery fees are incurred there.
      </p>

